WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.347
This is Effektive. Direct calls compile to typed effects in Effect TypeScript.

00:00:07.347 --> 00:00:14.536
The service header declares the dependency. The compiler infers the failures and the required operations.

00:00:15.536 --> 00:00:22.193
Add a function that calls get user. Its contract also carries both failures and the Users service.

00:00:23.693 --> 00:00:30.101
An explicit fails never clause forbids expected failures. The compiler rejects this bound because the body can fail.

00:00:31.101 --> 00:00:36.352
Remove the bound. The error clears, and the compiler infers the complete contract.

00:00:37.352 --> 00:00:42.084
The generated Effect type contains the result, both failures, and the required service.
